OL,3,GNEWSAHoliday balcony inquest hears
OL,4,Aengineer may not have known he was
OL,5,Afalling to his death
OL,6,
OL,7,FA software engineer may not have known
OL,8,Fhe was falling to his death from a
OL,9,Fbalcony, an inquest has heard.
OL,11,FKieran Hughes, 25, from Nant Gwynant,
OL,12,FGwynedd, died in the early hours of 11
OL,13,FJuly, 2025, while on holiday in Malta
OL,14,Fwith three friends.
OL,16,FA post-mortem examination by Maltese
OL,17,Fauthorities found there was a
OL,18,F"substantial level" of alcohol in his
OL,19,Fblood.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,434,430,260,140,0,100
